{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4a11d99b58dee6a10a0333147bc03c3d6c71d737e65e2e519732872f43bab6b4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"swapperfinance/swapper-toolkit@deb74c56d9db snapshot fbc5afd676962fd5","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3e758bde1bc8f88eb90902e809e36284b38013426edb0fc22b30f0c6a55d874f","slc_9cbdbaf4b4bc9021f5f3510b8085772363962b3482dcecfda2ed6548046848b8"],"source_ids":["src_2d56c04eca73554e98f71095f3f89c10"],"text":"The toolkit is installed into agents via 'npx skills add swapperfinance/swapper-toolkit' and advertises compatibility with Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, Copilot, CrewAI, AutoGPT and any framework supporting the open skills standard.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_585e6782acb0c8494b60f8ead209e8e776a125511b6395d26a10a26c25e7de39","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"swapperfinance/swapper-toolkit@deb74c56d9db snapshot fbc5afd676962fd5","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9a3f323cfd9f225647d56c1340bb15251bba6b487b5195e6719b7b25e3d8c775"],"source_ids":["src_2d56c04eca73554e98f71095f3f89c10"],"text":"Supported deposit chains are listed as Ethereum, Base, Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon, Fast, Solana, HyperEVM, BNB Chain and Avalanche.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_59aaa9bbd5212179867626b3db6ed82760c0a176ba749c657a5cc315806b8449","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"swapperfinance/swapper-toolkit@deb74c56d9db snapshot fbc5afd676962fd5","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_aa4223c74ba29bcebbea51666d5a227ec5ba3a47b35b270bdc345ea1d8cc753b","slc_fc019967ae5ee4d89f6d43cd94d52d1aa2c9c7010a0bb4b59c4164a7a75b44a4"],"source_ids":["src_2d56c04eca73554e98f71095f3f89c10"],"text":"The deposit flow is link-based: the skill generates a deposit link for browser confirmation rather than executing transactions itself, and every transaction requires explicit user approval with fees and risks surfaced beforehand.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5edadca7d368cae93da13666235d11c6f318f95953cb3e95712d699b44c82618","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"swapperfinance/swapper-toolkit@deb74c56d9db snapshot fbc5afd676962fd5","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_08311eb53e2b4865676a76d3849432b93d0c64f2e19755942882fcfd9de69e2a","slc_a26f6c887e8a5e859771831e7a521bda7a2dac7d848f1f2606b5a44e72016e1a","slc_b48116417af9fd5a1b6f7a2e1b3bc0c42ffcd1b7ae1de9f521a8797619ef393a"],"source_ids":["src_2d56c04eca73554e98f71095f3f89c10"],"text":"An npm SDK, @swapper-finance/deposit-sdk, exposes openSwapperModal accepting integratorId, destination chain ID and token address, deposit wallet address, theme styles, and supported deposit options like transferCrypto and depositWithCash.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a09cd3ad3b5258c6d7805f362061e65343fbc6c9c74d2e450adffbd5873e284b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"swapperfinance/swapper-toolkit@deb74c56d9db snapshot fbc5afd676962fd5","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fc019967ae5ee4d89f6d43cd94d52d1aa2c9c7010a0bb4b59c4164a7a75b44a4"],"source_ids":["src_2d56c04eca73554e98f71095f3f89c10"],"text":"The toolkit states private keys are never stored or accessed and transactions are never auto-approved.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b22d0316aaa81831498e8675d4894f0362fad00469007437eb218765b3a30bd0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"swapperfinance/swapper-toolkit@deb74c56d9db snapshot fbc5afd676962fd5","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_63fdfe85340e62cc2b4a318ab68acd122c0a66ec9a9a61f37a6bd20c5775431f","slc_bd359475b81ed6b6188e98f7693963396468e3193dff20143ee6f131c1f50c06","slc_ea29b85ec171ddae80e52c97f31b05b61f6521411857f9754af4d164438c9d35"],"source_ids":["src_6c177a8e26ac5c65abc4af03c37a5bd8"],"text":"Repository development practice: CLAUDE.md instructs that the deposit skill builds a Swapper deeplink with a hardcoded integratorId, uses the zero address for native tokens, and that agents must display the full deeplink URL, never auto-approve transactions, surface fees and risks, and never store or access private keys.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b6103ce019f3f96fba8e601eb08f91fc6d96b77fd6b98f7b6c894b1da705805c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"swapperfinance/swapper-toolkit@deb74c56d9db snapshot fbc5afd676962fd5","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ed09c26e5f240dddc87a1c9f84d89c20d62930bd96c7749880f8daf65c789464"],"source_ids":["src_2d56c04eca73554e98f71095f3f89c10"],"text":"Deposits support direct transfers to any wallet address, cross-chain bridging via CCIP, protocol deposits into lending, staking and liquidity pools, and fiat on-ramps via Mastercard, Visa, Apple Pay and Google Pay.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a62ba7d8262846e090b9fb069276df7a"}
